  "faqEligibilityQ": "How do I check my eligibility for a scheme?",
  "faqEligibilityA": "Fill in your profile details (age, gender, state, income, etc.) in the Profile tab, then browse the Search tab, where each scheme shows whether it matches your profile. For a quick check, you can also try the assessment under Discover.",
  "faqApplyQ": "How can I apply for a scheme?",
  "faqApplyA": "Select any scheme to see its detailed description, benefits, and required documents. Tap the 'Apply Now' button to open the official government application portal in your browser.",
  "faqTrackQ": "Where can I track my application status?",
  "faqTrackA": "Since application submissions are processed directly on official government portals, you can track your status by logging into the respective portal using the application ID provided during submission.",
  "faqFreeQ": "Is MSS app free to use?",
  "faqFreeA": "Yes, MSS is completely free to use. Our goal is to make citizen benefits and government schemes accessible to everyone in India without any hidden fees.",
  "faqDataFreshnessQ": "How often is new data updated?",
  "faqDataFreshnessA": "Our database is updated daily to reflect the latest announcements, schemes, subsidies, and application guidelines from the central and state ministries.",
  "faqScoringQ": "How does the recommendation scoring work?",
  "faqScoringA": "We evaluate your profile (residency, age, gender, education, and community) against the criteria set by each scheme. A match score is calculated out of 100% depending on the percentage of conditions met.",
  "faqDataSharingQ": "Is my personal data shared with the government?",
  "faqDataSharingA": "No. MSS is a recommendation tool that runs fully on your device. We do not share your profile details with external departments. You apply directly on official portals.",
  "faqMissingDocsQ": "How do I obtain missing documents?",
  "faqMissingDocsA": "In the Scheme Details view, any document marked as \"Missing\" has a \"Get Document\" link that redirects you directly to the official portal (e.g., UIDAI for Aadhaar, NSDL for PAN).",
